Subject: dt-bindings: media: document the Skyworth YK remote keymap


The Skyworth YK-series set-top-box remote decodes to NEC extended codes
that no map in the tree covers.
Name its keymap in the rc.yaml list so it can be selected from the device
tree, just like the other keymaps this file enumerates.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)


diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml
index 43d84296e70d..33d8059d0593 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml
@@ -126,6 +126,7 @@ properties:
       - rc-real-audio-220-32-keys
       - rc-reddo
       - rc-siemens-gigaset-rc20
+      - rc-skyworth-yk
       - rc-snapstream-firefly
       - rc-streamzap
       - rc-su3000
